{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45000","headline":"荅裴济从事 · 皎然","name":"荅裴济从事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"迟迟云鹤意，奋翅知有期。\n三秉纲纪局，累登清白资。\n应怀青塘居，蕙草没前墀。\n旧月照秋水，废田留故陂。\n至今高风在，爲君吹桂枝。\n昨逢洞庭客，果得故人诗。\n何异王内史，来招道林师。\n欲携山侣出，难与白云辞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45000.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45000","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}